        "kind": "received_sentence",
        "person_id": "ceq_pnr_q0e",
        "source_quote": "晉太常融七世孫也。",
        "reading": "稱為晉太常殷融七世孫。",
        "note": "稱為晉太常殷融七世孫。",
        "paragraph_id": "c-nanqishu-049-yinrui:p001",
        "start_codepoint": 10,
        "end_codepoint": 19,
        "human_reviewed": false
      },
      {
        "id": "c-nanqishu-049-yinrui:received_sentence1-19",
        "kind": "received_sentence",
        "person_id": "ceq_pnr_q0e",
        "source_quote": "宋元嘉末，祖元素坐染太初事誅。",
        "reading": "祖父元素在宋元嘉末因受牽涉劉劭事誅。",
        "note": "祖父元素在宋元嘉末因受牽涉劉劭事誅。",
        "paragraph_id": "c-nanqishu-049-yinrui:p001",
        "start_codepoint": 19,
        "end_codepoint": 34,
        "human_reviewed": false
      },
      {
        "id": "c-nanqishu-049-yinrui:received_sentence1-34",
        "kind": "received_sentence",
        "person_id": "ceq_pnr_q0e",
        "source_quote": "叡遺腹亦當從戮，外曾祖王僧朗啓孝武救之，得免。",
        "reading": "叡為遺腹子，本當從戮，外曾祖王僧朗奏請孝武救免。",
        "note": "叡為遺腹子，本當從戮，外曾祖王僧朗奏請孝武救免。",
        "paragraph_id": "c-nanqishu-049-yinrui:p001",
        "start_codepoint": 34,
        "end_codepoint": 57,
        "human_reviewed": false
      },
      {
        "id": "c-nanqishu-049-yinrui:received_sentence1-57",
        "kind": "received_sentence",
        "person_id": "ceq_pnr_q0e",
        "source_quote": "叡解文義，有口才，司徒褚淵甚重之，謂之曰：「諸殷自荊州以來，無出卿右者。」",
        "reading": "褚淵重叡才辯，以荊州殷仲堪與當面所稱卿作比較。",
        "note": "褚淵重叡才辯，以荊州殷仲堪與當面所稱卿作比較。",
        "paragraph_id": "c-nanqishu-049-yinrui:p001",
        "start_codepoint": 57,
        "end_codepoint": 94,
        "human_reviewed": false
      },
      {
        "id": "c-nanqishu-049-yinrui:received_sentence1-94",
        "kind": "received_sentence",
        "person_id": "ceq_pnr_q0e",
        "source_quote": "叡歛容答曰：「殷族衰悴，誠不如昔，若此旨爲虛，故不足降；此旨爲實，彌不可聞。」",
        "reading": "叡回答稱族望已衰，謝其過譽。",
        "note": "叡回答稱族望已衰，謝其過譽。",
        "paragraph_id": "c-nanqishu-049-yinrui:p001",
        "start_codepoint": 94,
        "end_codepoint": 133,
        "human_reviewed": false
      },
      {
        "id": "c-nanqishu-049-yinrui:received_sentence1-133",
        "kind": "received_sentence",
        "person_id": "ceq_pnr_q0e",
        "source_quote": "奐爲雍州，啓叡爲府長史。",
        "reading": "王奐鎮雍州時奏請以叡為府長史。",
        "note": "王奐鎮雍州時奏請以叡為府長史。",
